          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bashimapepo bafuma mu muputule wamushilo. Bashimapepo bonse abali kulya baliisangulwile, takwali na kusakamana iciputulwa babombelamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonse abena Levi abali bakemba wa nyimbo Asafu, Hemani, Yedutuni, abana babo na ba ndupwa shabo baiminina ku kabanga ka bulambo, nabafwala ifyakufwala ifyabusaka, balelisha imiwaya, amaseese ne nsango. Bali na bashimapepo umwanda umo na makumi yabili (120) abalelisha amapenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
